      <Desc>DSCSC PROMOTES THE COMMON GOOD AND GENERAL WELFARE OF THE RESIDENTS IN THE DEL SUR COMMUNITY AND THE GENERAL PUBLIC THROUGH CIVIC BETTERMENTS AND SOCIAL IMPROVEMENTS BY PROVIDING RECREATIONAL ACTIVITIES AS WELL AS OTHER SERVICES TO THE RESIDENTS AND VISITORS OF THE DEL SUR COMMUNITY. AMONG THE RECREATIONAL ACTIVITIES AND SERVICES THAT ARE PROVDED BY DSCSC ARE THE FOLLOWING:SPECIAL INTEREST PROGRAMS - DSCSC ESTABLISHES, COORDINATES, AND SPONSORS PROGRAMS TO PROMOTE THE INTERESTS OF AND FOR THE BENEFIT OF PERSONS LIVING IN THE DEL SUR COMMUNITY. SUCH ACTIVITIES INCLUDE EDUCATIONAL, ENVIRONMENTAL, AND HEALTH AND WELLNESS PROGRAMS.HOLIDAY PARTIES AND EVENTS - DSCSC ESTABLISHES, COORDINATES, AND SPONSORS ACTIVITIES, EVENTS AND SERVICES TO PROMOTE AND SUPPORT SPORTS AND RECREATIONAL ACTIVITIES AND LEAGUES FOR THE BENEFIT OF THE DEL SUR COMMUNITY.TECHNOLOGY PROGRAMS - DSCSC ESTABLISHES AND ELECTRONIC TOWNHALL, LIBRARY AND COMMUNICATIONS CENTER FOR THE BENEFIT OF THE DEL SUR COMMUNITY.</Desc>
